          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu hati naaza kukworeka amazima. Reeba, omuri Buperisi haryaimukamu abandi bagabe bashatu, kandi owa kana aryakiriza kimwe abo bonshatu obutungi; ku ariheza kugira amaani ahabw'obutungi bwe, aryimutsya engabo ze zoona kurwanisa obugabe wa Bugriika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima haryayema omugabe rugambwa, ategyekyese obushoboorozi bwingi, atwza nk'oku arikwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ariheza kuhama, obugabe bwe buryacwekamu ebicweka, bubaganisibwemu nibutoora ei emiyaga ena y'omu iguru ereetwa; kandi tiburihungurwa ruzaaro rwe, n'obu kwakuba okugaruka aha buteeka nk'oku yaabaire naakibutegyeka, ahabw'okuba obugabe bwe buryarandurwa, butwarwe abandi abatari abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aryagira amaani; kwonka omwe aha bakuru b'engabo ze aryamukiza amaani, kandi obugabe bwe buryaba buhango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku harihinguraho emyaka, baryakwatanisa; bwanyima muhara w'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo aryaza owa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso kuragaana endagaano y'okugarukana; kwonka ogwo mwishiki tariguma na maani g'obushoboorozi bwe, n'omushaija we tarigumaho n'obu rwakuba oruzaaro rwe, kureka ogwo mwishiki n'abaragaragwa be n'omwana we n'omushaija owaamushweire baryaheebwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ebiro ebyo, omwe ow'omu ruzaaro rw'ogwo mwishiki, orikumukomookaho, aryaimuka, ahungurire ishenkuru; aryarwansia ihe ryabo, ataahe omu kigo ky'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso, abarwanise, abasingure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryanyaga baaruhanga baabo, n'ebishushani byabo ebiheesirwe, n'ebintu byabo by'obuguzi bwingi eby'efeeza n'eby'ezaabu, abitware Misri. Kandi aryamara emyaka atarikuteera mugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ogwo mugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryateera ensi y'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, kwonka aryagaruka atyo omu nsi ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 11:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.8.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 8:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abatabani baryahuruza abantu, bateerane engabo nyingi munonga; ezo ngabo ziryateera ensi, zigijanjaare yoona, zoogymu, zigumizemu nizirwana, zihikye n'aha kigo ky'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekirirugamu, ogwo mugabe aryagira ekiniga, ahurure, arwane n'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. Ogwo mugabe aryahuruza eihe rihango munonga, kwonka riyrakwatwa abazigu be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, ku ariheza kukwata ezo ngabo, aryayetunguura, aziitemu obukumi n'obukumi, kwonka taribasingurira kimwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso aryagaruka, ahuruze eihe rihango munonga eririkukira ery'okubanza; ku harihinguraho emyaka, aryahurura n'engabo nyingi n'ebintu bingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuri obwo bunaku baingi baryaimuka kurwanisa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, n'ababisha b'omu ihanga ryawe baryaimuka kuhikiiriza ebyayorekirwe, kwonka baryaremwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho aryaija, agote orurembo orwehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare ezigumire, arurundeho eby'okutemberaho, arukwate. Engabo z'omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo, nangwa n'ez'entoore, tiziribaasa, ahabw'okuba tizirigira garwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.8.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 8:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kureka oriija kumurwanisa, aryakora nk'oku arikwenda, kandi tihariho orimuza omu kaso; bwanyima aryayemerera omu nsi y'ekitiinisa, yoona eze omu bushoboorozi bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryamariirira kuhuruza engabo z'obugabe bwe bwona, aragaane n'ogwo mugabe ebyakubaasa kureeta obusingye, abihikiirize. Aryahingira omugabe wa Misri muhara we, ngu abone kushiisha obwo bugabe. Kwonka enaama ye terihikiirira, kandi terigira ki yaamugasira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima aryahinduka ateere ebirwa, akubuure bingi; kwonka omukur w'eihe ondiijo aryamaraho emyekuniko ye; kandi egyo myekuniko ye nayo emuhindukane, emushongye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima aryahindukira ebigo by'omu nsi ye, kwonka aryateera entsibo, agwe aburire kimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima haryaimuka ondiijo omu mwanya gwe, ayohereze orikushoza omushoro, arabe omu nsi y'ekitiinisa; kwonka ku harihinguraho ebiro bikye, nawe aryacwekyerezibwa, ataitsirwe na kiniga, n'obu kwakuba okugwa omu rugamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwanya gwe haryaimuka omuntu orikugaywa, otakaheebwaga kitiinisa ky'obugabe; aryaija atamanyirwe, aheebwe obugabe ahabw'okwesiigisiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahe garyatwarirwa kimwe omu maisho ge, gataataane, kandi n'Omukuru w'endagaano nawe abe atyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ku bariheza kuragaana nawe endagaano, aryakora eby'obugobya, ahindukye ow'amaani, haza aine abantu bakye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima aryateera ekicweka ky'egyo nsi ekirikukira oburungi atamanyirwe, akore eki baishe na baishenkuru batarakozire, abaganisize abantu be emicwijuro n'eminyago n'eby'obutungi. Kandi aryagira enaama z'okuteera ebigo byayo ebigumire, kwonka okumara akaanya kakye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima ayeteere ebinyomyo, agire obumanzi bw'okurwanisa omugabe w'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo n'eihe ringi; ogwo mugabe aryahurura n'eihe rihango munonga kandi ery'amaani; kwonka tarigumaho, ahabw'okuba baryamugirira enaama mbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nangwa n'abariba batungirwe eby'okurya bye nibo barimucwekyereza; eihe rye riryatwarwa, kandi baingi omuriryo baitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.11.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 11:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abo bagabe bombi emitima yaabo eryararamira okukora eby'eitima; baryaguma nibabeihana bashutami aha meeza emwe, kwonka ebyo biryaba ebya busha, ahabw'okuba omuheru gwabyo guryabaho omu bunaku bwagwo obwatairweho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima aryagaruka omu nsi ye n'ebintu bingi, kandi omutima gwe guryaba nigukyanga endagaano erikwera. Aryakora eki arikwenda, agarukye omu nsi ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
