            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ogwo mugabe aryakora nk'oku arikwenda, ayetunguure, ayekuze okukira baaruhanga boona, agambe ebirikutangaaza eby'okurogota ahari Ruhanga Nyamuhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogwo mugabe taryeta hari baaruhanga ba baishenkuru, nari okwetenga abakazi n'obu kyakuba ekyetwa ruhanga kyona, ahakuba aryayekuza okukira boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwanya gw'okuha baaruhanga abo ekitiinisa aryakiha ruhanga w'ebigo; kandi ruhanga ou baishenkuru baabaire batakamanyaga, niwe ariha ekitiinisa, naamutoijera ezaabu, efeeza, obubaare bw'obuguzi bwingi, n'ebiconco ebirikushemeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryasingura ebigo by'amaani naahwerwa ruhanga otakamanywaga; kandi abarimwemera kuba abe aryabakuza n'ekitiinisa, abahindure abategyeki b'abaingi, ababaganisize ensi ahabw'enguzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
