              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryabangira amahanga maingi omukono, n'ensi ya Misri terimukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryagira obushoboorozi aha bintu ebibiikirwe, eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza n'ebya Misri byona eby'obuguzi bwingi; kandi Abalibya n'Abanyesiopia baryagyenda bamukuratiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka bwanyima amakuru agariruga oburugwa-izooba n'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso garyamwemereza omutima, ahurure n'ekiniga kingi kuhwerekyereza baingi n'okubamariraho kimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
