          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aryateera amahema ge g'obugabe ahagati y'enyanja n'orushozi orurikwera orw'ekitiinisa; kwonka aryahika aha muheru gw'amagara ge, ataine kihwera.",
          "type": "text",
